// A parity echo broken by a diagonal seam of rock.
name Fracture
rule B1357/S1357
steps 3
hint Rock cuts through this echo. Rock is never alive and never counts as a neighbour.
tip The echo would be symmetric without the seam. Mirror the intact half to find the centre.
